|

:INFO
Art. 43 Transitional provisions for time limits currently in force
Time limits set by the IPI that are running on the day this Ordinance comes into force shall remain unchanged.
|

:INFO
Art. 43a
Inserted by No I of the O of 18 Oct. 2006 (AS 2006 4481). Repealed by No I of the O of 14 March 2008, with effect from 1 July 2008 (AS 2008 1895).
|

:INFO
Art. 44 Commencement
This Ordinance comes into force on 1 July 2002.

